# examples/stream/tb_stream_demux_demo.verif
#
# **Stream Demux 示例的验证源**（ADR-074 D1 · 单一语义来源）
#
# ⚠️ 本文件是**唯一语义来源**：IR 解释器（驱动 `Simulator`）与 Verilog 渲染器
#    （生成 `.sv` TB）都由它派生 ⇒ ⇒ 两侧断言**不可能**漂移。
# ⚠️ 期望值的**推导**在 `@expect-src` 指向的登记文档里（人登记）；本文件只承载机器值。
# ⚠️ 时序锚点：SET 在「沿后采样窗」内生效；EXPECT 读「最近一次结算之后」的值
#    ⇒ ⇒ `SET → EXPECT` MUST 先 `SETTLE`（扫描器静态强制）。
#
# 被测语义（capability `chlib-stream-ready-ownership` 的「分流 / 分叉类」条 · ADR-056）：
#   · `out[i].valid`   = `in.valid & (select == i)`
#   · `out[i].payload` = `(select == i) ? in.payload : 0`
#   · `in.ready`       = `in_range & out[select].ready`（消费端 ⇒ 上游）
#   ⚠️ `select` 宽 2 bit 且 `N = 4` ⇒ ⇒ **越界形态在本设计不可达**
#      （capability 的「越界 ⇒ 挡住上游」条在此不适用 ⇒ 已在期望源登记）。
#
# 原语封闭集：SET / TICK / SETTLE / WAIT / EXPECT / EXPECT_STABLE / OBSERVE / RESET
#
@expect-src .rddf/checks/examples-rtl-expectations.md#stream-demux-demo
@tb-module tb_stream_demux_demo

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 场景 1：框架复位后的默认态（impl-contract：框架复位把全部数据输入置 0）
#   · select=0 / in_valid=0 / 四路 out*_ready=0
#   ⇒ ⇒ 全部输出 valid=0 · 被选中路（out0）payload=0 · in_ready=0
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
@scenario reset_defaults
@anchor stream-demux-demo

SET select 0
SETTLE
EXPECT out0_valid 0
EXPECT out1_valid 0
EXPECT out2_valid 0
EXPECT out3_valid 0
EXPECT out0_payload 0
EXPECT in_ready 0

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 场景 2：payload / valid 跟随 select（spec-derived：分发的定义）
#   · in_payload=0xAB / in_valid=1 / 四路 ready=1
#   · select=k ⇒ 仅 out[k].valid=1 且 payload=0xAB；其余 valid=0 且 payload=0
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
@scenario payload_follows_select

SET in_payload 0xAB
SET in_valid 1
SET out0_ready 1
SET out1_ready 1
SET out2_ready 1
SET out3_ready 1

SET select 0
SETTLE
EXPECT out0_valid 1
EXPECT out0_payload 0xAB
EXPECT out1_valid 0
EXPECT out2_valid 0
EXPECT out3_valid 0
EXPECT out1_payload 0
EXPECT out2_payload 0
EXPECT out3_payload 0
EXPECT in_ready 1

SET select 1
SETTLE
EXPECT out1_valid 1
EXPECT out1_payload 0xAB
EXPECT out0_valid 0
EXPECT out0_payload 0
EXPECT out2_valid 0
EXPECT out3_valid 0

SET select 2
SETTLE
EXPECT out2_valid 1
EXPECT out2_payload 0xAB
EXPECT out1_valid 0
EXPECT out3_valid 0

SET select 3
SETTLE
EXPECT out3_valid 1
EXPECT out3_payload 0xAB
EXPECT out2_valid 0
EXPECT out0_valid 0

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 场景 3：反压由消费端 ⇒ 上游（spec-derived：ready 方向 + 隔离）
#   · select=2 · out2_ready=0 ⇒ in_ready=0（上游停顿 = 可观测）
#   · **非选中路**的 ready 不影响上游（out0/out1/out3 仍为 1）
#   · 数据面 MUST NOT 依赖 ready（out2_valid / out2_payload 保持）
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
@scenario backpressure_reaches_upstream

SET in_payload 0xCD
SET in_valid 1
SET out0_ready 1
SET out1_ready 1
SET out2_ready 0
SET out3_ready 1

SET select 2
SETTLE
EXPECT in_ready 0
EXPECT out2_valid 1
EXPECT out2_payload 0xCD

SET out2_ready 1
SETTLE
EXPECT in_ready 1

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 场景 4：上游无有效数据 ⇒ 全部输出无效（spec-derived：valid 只依赖 in.valid）
#   · in_valid=0 ⇒ 四路 valid 全 0（数据面与反压面分离）
#   · in_ready 仍 = 被选中路的 ready（= 1）⇒ ⇒ ready 不依赖 valid
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
@scenario no_valid_all_outputs_idle

SET in_valid 0
SET out0_ready 1
SET out1_ready 1
SET out2_ready 1
SET out3_ready 1

SET select 1
SETTLE
EXPECT out0_valid 0
EXPECT out1_valid 0
EXPECT out2_valid 0
EXPECT out3_valid 0
EXPECT in_ready 1
